WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.390
From late 1991,
Stepanakert lay under siege,

2
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.002
under the guns of the Shushi plateau.

3
00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.752
Grad rockets struck
houses and schools,

4
00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:13.898
and families lived in basements.

5
00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:19.188
On 8 May 1992, Armenian units
attacked Shushi,

6
00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.602
and by 9 May the town was taken.

7
00:00:21.642 --> 00:00:24.217
The bombardment of Stepanakert ended.

8
00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:28.427
Keep the basements safe
until the heights are won.

